    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-cream">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:1100px;">

    <div class="show-results-registry">
      <p>Full pedigree and official show history for Klippets Tirhild are on Hitta Älghund.</p>
      <a href="https://www.hittaalghund.se/dog.asp?regnummer=SE48735/2023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View record →</a>
    </div>

